# Jane Street processor design project
#
# Keep the inputs needed to reproduce the design in Git:
#   RTL and testbenches:     *.v, *.sv, *.vhd
#   constraints and scripts: *.sdc, *.tcl
#   Quartus project files:   *.qpf, *.qsf, *.qdf
#   Quartus/IP sources:      *.ip, *.qip, *.sip, *.qsys, *.sopcinfo
#   memory contents:         *.mif, *.hex
#
# Generated files should go in build/ where possible.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
